# Applies to every Docker build in this repo - both project/backend/Dockerfile and
# deploy/runner.Dockerfile use the repo root as their build context (see each file's own
# header comment), and Docker resolves .dockerignore from the context root, not from
# wherever -f points. A .dockerignore previously lived at project/backend/.dockerignore,
# which was silently never read for that reason - moved here instead.

.git/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log

# Dev/test/tooling-only - never needed by any image built from this repo.
tests/
sim/
devtools/
visualizer/
info/
dump*.json
*.log

# Offline reel-strip tooling inside project/engine/, which project/backend/Dockerfile copies
# whole: the generator scripts and the CSV sources they write. The engine only requires
# data/reels/*.json at runtime (config/reels.js); tests and sim/ still use these from the repo.
project/engine/data/convertReels.js
project/engine/data/generateReels.js
project/engine/data/reelWeights.js
project/engine/data/reels/*.csv
# Build recipe, not runtime content (Docker still reads it to build).
project/backend/Dockerfile
